// Embeds the RNNoise model weights (native/rnnoise/weights_blob.bin,
// vendored into windows/rnnoise/ by tool/vendor_flutter_webrtc.ps1) as a
// raw-data Windows resource, loaded at runtime via FindResource/
// LoadResource/LockResource in audio_noise_suppressor.cc's
// LoadEmbeddedModel(). RCDATA is the standard resource type for
// arbitrary binary blobs; RT_RCDATA is how audio_noise_suppressor.cc
// looks it up. The resource name (not a numeric ID -- simpler, no
// shared resource.h needed between this file and the .cc loader) must
// match the "RNNOISE_WEIGHTS" string literal there exactly.

RNNOISE_WEIGHTS RCDATA "rnnoise/weights_blob.bin"
